{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 97,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        174.74769592285156,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.1642456054688,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "Patients with complicated extrapulmonary TB involving the CNS, osteoarticular and pericardial forms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996349334716797,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.3904418945312,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "of TB were not included in the BEAT-TB trial. Therefore, no specific analysis could be performed for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.4764404296875,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "this patient subgroup. Patients with uncomplicated extrapulmonary TB were included if they also had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992947578430176,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.1663208007812,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "pulmonary TB. Thus, the recommendation for the BDLLfxC regimen applies to people with pulmonary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969306945800781,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.42138671875,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "TB and all forms of extrapulmonary TB except for TB involving the CNS, osteoarticular or disseminated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96679973602295,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        262.4740295410156,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "forms of TB with multiorgan involvement.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        186.66664123535156,
        373.8372802734375,
        202.32662963867188
      ],
      "text": "Extensive TB disease and resistance to fluoroquinolones",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.5345001220703,
        527.5521240234375,
        223.9774932861328
      ],
      "text": "Patients with DR-TB who have extensive disease face greater challenges in treatment across all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.73451232910156,
        527.3859252929688,
        237.17750549316406
      ],
      "text": "regimens and are at a higher risk of unfavourable outcomes and amplification of drug resistance.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.9345245361328,
        527.4146118164062,
        250.3775177001953
      ],
      "text": "This risk is further elevated in those infected with pathogens that have advanced resistance profiles,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.13453674316406,
        527.2451782226562,
        263.5775451660156
      ],
      "text": "particularly with additional resistance to fluoroquinolones. These patients may experience slightly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        262.33453369140625,
        527.1534423828125,
        276.7775573730469
      ],
      "text": "worse outcomes compared to those without pre-XDR and develop resistance to regimen components.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.955660820007324,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        275.53448486328125,
        527.5396728515625,
        289.9775085449219
      ],
      "text": "In the BEAT-TB trial among patients with pre-XDR-TB, the outcomes also appeared worse than among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964191436767578,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.7344970703125,
        527.103271484375,
        303.1775207519531
      ],
      "text": "those who were fluoroquinolone susceptible. This reduction in the proportion with successful treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949182510375977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        301.93450927734375,
        527.3156127929688,
        316.3775329589844
      ],
      "text": "outcomes was numerically greater in the BDLLfxC arm than in the control arm (14.3% vs 3.3%);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        315.134521484375,
        527.4400634765625,
        329.5775451660156
      ],
      "text": "however, this difference was within the range of statistical uncertainty and the GDG judged that this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        328.3345031738281,
        527.2335815429688,
        342.77752685546875
      ],
      "text": "should not affect the recommendation or remarks. The rate of acquisition of resistance to bedaquiline",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981284141540527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.5345153808594,
        527.4430541992188,
        355.9775390625
      ],
      "text": "was similar between the two groups (11% in BDLLfxC and 9.1% in control). The evidence from the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        354.7344970703125,
        527.4574584960938,
        369.1775207519531
      ],
      "text": "BEAT-TB trial is insufficient to draw definitive conclusions due to the small sample when stratified by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.93450927734375,
        527.452392578125,
        382.3775329589844
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolone resistance and related imprecision. Nonetheless, clinicians should remain vigilant and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979631423950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.1344909667969,
        527.4442138671875,
        395.5775146484375
      ],
      "text": "closely monitor the treatment response in this group of patients and promptly take relevant actions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        394.3345031738281,
        360.88665771484375,
        408.77752685546875
      ],
      "text": "(extending the duration of treatment or changing the regimen).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.1517333984375,
        245.23455810546875,
        438.00372314453125
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        445.2117004394531,
        527.5818481445312,
        459.65472412109375
      ],
      "text": "The high treatment success rates shown for the BDLLfxC regimen in the BEAT-TB trial and favourable",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997149467468262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        458.4117126464844,
        527.4024658203125,
        472.854736328125
      ],
      "text": "comparison with the current SoC regimens led to an overall recommendation for implementation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        471.6116943359375,
        527.5606689453125,
        486.0547180175781
      ],
      "text": "under routine programmatic conditions. Given that this recommendation is conditional, ongoing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.81170654296875,
        527.1199340820312,
        499.2547302246094
      ],
      "text": "operational research will be needed, to add further knowledge that can be used to adjust and improve",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962234497070312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.7357177734375,
        282.8675842285156,
        512.4547119140625
      ],
      "text": "(8) implementation guidance for the regimen  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.8555908203125,
        160.5745086669922,
        544.515625
      ],
      "text": "Patient selection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        551.7235107421875,
        527.4478149414062,
        566.16650390625
      ],
      "text": "Eligibility for the BDLLfxC regimen should generally align with the criteria outlined in the BEAT-TB trial.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979931831359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.9234619140625,
        527.393798828125,
        579.366455078125
      ],
      "text": "Once patients are started on treatment, providing effective support is crucial to ensure treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.12353515625,
        527.4212036132812,
        592.5665283203125
      ],
      "text": "adherence. Close monitoring (for AEs, responses to treatment and developing drug resistance) is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.323486328125,
        524.4181518554688,
        605.7664794921875
      ],
      "text": "essential, as are proper management of side effects and prevention of complications from drug–",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.5234985351562,
        150.91310119628906,
        618.9664916992188
      ],
      "text": "drug interactions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.3673706054688,
        213.38893127441406,
        651.0274047851562
      ],
      "text": "Drug susceptibility testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.2352905273438,
        527.1512451171875,
        672.6782836914062
      ],
      "text": "A comprehensive history of prior exposure to the regimen’s components and the outcomes of previous",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.949483871459961,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.435302734375,
        527.1903076171875,
        685.8782958984375
      ],
      "text": "episodes of TB should be taken. Prior loss to the programme while on a bedaquiline-containing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.6353149414062,
        527.4432373046875,
        699.0783081054688
      ],
      "text": "regimen, particularly if the culture is still positive when this occurs, increases the risk of developing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        696.559326171875,
        197.22010803222656,
        712.2783203125
      ],
      "text": "(52) bedaquiline resistance  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.5391845703125,
        527.3772583007812,
        733.982177734375
      ],
      "text": "DST for FQ is strongly advised, although it should not delay the initiation of the BDLLfxC. When DST",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.7393188476562,
        527.3892822265625,
        747.1823120117188
      ],
      "text": "results confirm FQ susceptibility, clofazimine should be stopped, then BDLLfx can continue. When",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.9393310546875,
        527.3915405273438,
        760.38232421875
      ],
      "text": "DST results confirm FQ resistance, levofloxacin should be stopped, then BDLC can continue. If DST is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.1392211914062,
        355.5022277832031,
        773.5822143554688
      ],
      "text": "not done or is unavailable, then all five drugs should be given.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  83",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}